      "name": "Classic Hover Overlay",
      "description": "Clean grid where project details appear on hover with a smooth dark overlay",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ptg1-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .ptg1-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .ptg1-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:50px;}\n                          .ptg1-head h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,42px);font-weight:900;color:#111;margin:0 0 15px;}\n                          .ptg1-head p{color:#6b7280;font-size:18px;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .ptg1-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));gap:30px;}\n                          .ptg1-item{position:relative;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;cursor:pointer;}\n                          .ptg1-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);}\n                          .ptg1-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(17,17,17,0.7);opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.4s ease;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:20px;text-align:center;}\n                          .ptg1-item:hover .ptg1-img{transform:scale(1.1);}\n                          .ptg1-item:hover .ptg1-overlay{opacity:1;}\n                          .ptg1-title{color:#fff;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;transform:translateY(20px);transition:transform 0.4s ease, opacity 0.4s ease;opacity:0;}\n                          .ptg1-cat{color:#10b981;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;transform:translateY(20px);transition:transform 0.4s ease 0.1s, opacity 0.4s ease 0.1s;opacity:0;}\n                          .ptg1-item:hover .ptg1-title,.ptg1-item:hover .ptg1-cat{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.ptg1-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));gap:20px;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ptg1-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"ptg1-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"ptg1-head\">\n                              <h2>Our Work</h2>\n                              <p>Discover our latest projects and creative endeavors.</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"ptg1-grid\">\n                              <div class=\"ptg1-item\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg1-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Web Design\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg1-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg1-title\">Fintech Dashboard</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg1-cat\">UI/UX Design</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg1-item\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg1-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558655146-d09347e92766?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Branding\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg1-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg1-title\">Modern Agency</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg1-cat\">Branding</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg1-item\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg1-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744094-3a31f272c490?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"App\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg1-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg1-title\">Fitness App</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg1-cat\">Mobile Dev</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg1-item\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg1-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1460925895917-afdab827c52f?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Marketing\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg1-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg1-title\">SEO Campaign</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg1-cat\">Marketing</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg1-item\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg1-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522542550221-31fd19575a2d?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Design\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg1-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg1-title\">Interior Studio</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg1-cat\">Web Design</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg1-item\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg1-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Workspace\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg1-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg1-title\">Tech Startup</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg1-cat\">Consulting</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
