      "description": "Sleek dark theme where text sits elegantly below each project image",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ptg2-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#050505;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .ptg2-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .ptg2-head{margin-bottom:60px;}\n                          .ptg2-head h2{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,48px);font-weight:800;color:#f9fafb;margin:0 0 10px;}\n                          .ptg2-head p{color:#a1a1aa;font-size:18px;margin:0;}\n                          .ptg2-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));gap:40px 30px;}\n                          .ptg2-img-box{overflow:hidden;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px;background:#111;aspect-ratio:3/4;}\n                          .ptg2-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform 0.5s ease;opacity:0.9;}\n                          .ptg2-item:hover .ptg2-img{transform:scale(1.05);opacity:1;}\n                          .ptg2-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 5px;transition:color 0.3s;}\n                          .ptg2-item:hover .ptg2-title{color:#6366f1;}\n                          .ptg2-cat{color:#71717a;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){.ptg2-grid{gap:30px 20px;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ptg2-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"ptg2-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"ptg2-head\">\n                              <h2>Selected Projects.</h2>\n                              <p>A collection of our finest digital experiences.</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"ptg2-grid\">\n                              <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\" class=\"ptg2-item\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg2-img-box\"><img class=\"ptg2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600132806370-bf17e65e942f?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Project 1\"></div>\n                                <h3 class=\"ptg2-title\">Neon Nights</h3>\n                                <p class=\"ptg2-cat\">Brand Identity</p>\n                              </a>\n                              <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\" class=\"ptg2-item\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg2-img-box\"><img class=\"ptg2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545235617-9465d2a55698?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Project 2\"></div>\n                                <h3 class=\"ptg2-title\">Aura Skincare</h3>\n                                <p class=\"ptg2-cat\">E-Commerce</p>\n                              </a>\n                              <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\" class=\"ptg2-item\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg2-img-box\"><img class=\"ptg2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Project 3\"></div>\n                                <h3 class=\"ptg2-title\">FinTrack App</h3>\n                                <p class=\"ptg2-cat\">UI/UX Design</p>\n                              </a>\n                              <a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\" class=\"ptg2-item\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg2-img-box\"><img class=\"ptg2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507238692094-02685957d195?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Project 4\"></div>\n                                <h3 class=\"ptg2-title\">Studio Alpha</h3>\n                                <p class=\"ptg2-cat\">Web Development</p>\n                              </a>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
