      "id": "portfolio-grid-4",
      "name": "Asymmetric Hero Grid",
      "description": "Modern asymmetric grid with one large featured project and smaller supporting projects",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ptg4-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .ptg4-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .ptg4-head{margin-bottom:40px;}\n                          .ptg4-head h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,44px);font-weight:900;color:#111;margin:0;}\n                          .ptg4-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);gap:20px;grid-auto-rows:300px;}\n                          .ptg4-item{position:relative;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#f1f5f9;cursor:pointer;}\n                          .ptg4-item-large{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2;}\n                          .ptg4-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform 0.7s;}\n                          .ptg4-item:hover .ptg4-img{transform:scale(1.05);}\n                          .ptg4-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 0%, transparent 60%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:30px;}\n                          .ptg4-title{color:#fff;font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 5px;}\n                          .ptg4-large-title{font-size:36px;}\n                          .ptg4-cat{color:#10b981;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;}\n                          @media(max-width:900px){\n                            .ptg4-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-auto-rows:250px;}\n                            .ptg4-item-large{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 1;}\n                          }\n                          @media(max-width:600px){\n                            .ptg4-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-auto-rows:300px;}\n                            .ptg4-item-large{grid-column:span 1;grid-row:span 1;}\n                          }\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ptg4-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"ptg4-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"ptg4-head\">\n                              <h2>Featured Work.</h2>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"ptg4-grid\">\n                              <div class=\"ptg4-item ptg4-item-large\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg4-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498050108023-c5249f4df085?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Large\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg4-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg4-title ptg4-large-title\">Nova Workspace</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg4-cat\">Interior Architecture</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg4-item\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg4-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744094-3a31f272c490?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Small\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg4-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg4-title\">Finance App</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg4-cat\">UI/UX</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg4-item\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg4-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558655146-d09347e92766?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" alt=\"Small\">\n                                <div class=\"ptg4-overlay\">\n                                  <h3 class=\"ptg4-title\">Brand Guide</h3>\n                                  <span class=\"ptg4-cat\">Design</span>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
