      "name": "Glassmorphism Masonry",
      "description": "Creative ambient background with glass-like cards floating in a grid",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ptg5-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b, #312e81, #4c1d95);font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .ptg5-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .ptg5-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:60px;}\n                          .ptg5-head h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,46px);font-weight:900;color:#fff;margin:0 0 15px;}\n                          .ptg5-head p{color:#c7d2fe;font-size:18px;}\n                          .ptg5-grid{column-count:3;column-gap:30px;}\n                          .ptg5-card{break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:30px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:20px;padding:20px;transition:transform 0.3s;}\n                          .ptg5-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);}\n                          .ptg5-img{width:100%;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:20px;}\n                          .ptg5-title{color:#fff;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 8px;}\n                          .ptg5-cat{color:#a5b4fc;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;}\n                          @media(max-width:900px){.ptg5-grid{column-count:2;}}\n                          @media(max-width:600px){.ptg5-grid{column-count:1;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"ptg5-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"ptg5-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"ptg5-head\">\n                              <h2>Creative Archive</h2>\n                              <p>Exploring the boundaries of digital art.</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"ptg5-grid\">\n                              <div class=\"ptg5-card\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg5-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover;\">\n                                <h3 class=\"ptg5-title\">Abstract Fluid</h3>\n                                <div class=\"ptg5-cat\">3D RENDER</div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg5-card\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg5-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550684848-fac1c5b4e853?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;\">\n                                <h3 class=\"ptg5-title\">Neon Interface</h3>\n                                <div class=\"ptg5-cat\">UI DESIGN</div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg5-card\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg5-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604871000636-074fa5117945?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;\">\n                                <h3 class=\"ptg5-title\">Pop Art Campaign</h3>\n                                <div class=\"ptg5-cat\">ILLUSTRATION</div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"ptg5-card\">\n                                <img class=\"ptg5-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507238692094-02685957d195?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;\">\n                                <h3 class=\"ptg5-title\">Minimal Desk</h3>\n                                <div class=\"ptg5-cat\">PHOTOGRAPHY</div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    }
